{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"851245990110560286","content":"Roy starts the fight farther back to shoot the wolf, doing his usual shooting, until at some point the wolf clocks a hit on Sabrine knocking her off her balance. Seeing this, Roy abandons his sniping position, shifts for extra speed, and pushes Sabrine out of the way, giving her time to prepare her gun, and taking a solid slash to the chest, that also ruins the suspenders a bit. Fortunately, they're more for show and additional pockets, and Roy does not end the fight with his pants down.\n(which is also a convenient excuse for the outfit change for the epilogue design)","created_at":"2021-08-25T09:14:40.892000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880017327855394827","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
