{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"851245990110560286","content":"As Roy protects her from the wolf, Sabrine freezes in fear, seeming to be stuck in the past for a moment.\nBut she breaks out. She takes aim, hopping to a position where the blast won't hit Roy. 'This is for everyone you've killed. May they rest in peace, and you rest in pieces.'\nshe charges her blunderbuss with magic, and fires, sending a blast of intense, shattering sound at the wolf, letting out a scream of combined fury and anguish as she does so.\n\nas the blast dissipates, she rushes to Roy's side.","created_at":"2021-08-25T09:14:51.948000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880017374227628032","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
